# Kakao Maps JavaScript key (developers.kakao.com > 내 애플리케이션 > 앱 키).
# Must be the JAVASCRIPT key — the REST API key is rejected by the JS SDK with
# 401 AccessDeniedError and window.kakao is then never defined.
#
# The app also needs, in the Kakao console:
#   - 카카오맵 service enabled (otherwise every search returns 403
#     "disabled OPEN_MAP_AND_LOCAL service")
#   - the site domain registered under 플랫폼 > Web
VITE_KAKAO_JS_KEY=
